{"id":"wb-4-180","name":"满堂围","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"满堂围","text":"满堂围位于中国广东省韶关市始兴县隘子镇满堂村，是一座客家围屋，1996年11月被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n满堂围始建于清道光十三年（1833年），为官姓家族所建，占地13000余平方米，由上围、中围、下围三个单元组成一个整体。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BB%A1%E5%A0%82%E5%9B%B4","revisionId":92314961,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92314961","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c94afa313c34df640780a7a2.jpg","title":"Shixing_Mantang_Wei_2014.01.11_13-19-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shixing_Mantang_Wei_2014.01.11_13-19-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/Shixing_Mantang_Wei_2014.01.11_13-19-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"广东省始兴县隘子镇满堂围——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}